      "content": "That makes sense for the overview. To make the paper more thorough, I need to look at the specific \"evidence\" they usually point to. Can you go into more detail on the specific studies or the types of genetic data they use to support these claims? Like, what are the core arguments regarding how these traits are inherited or why they think environmental factors don't fully explain the gap?",
